  ('lakefront-greece-colonial', 'For Sale', 539000, '184 Edgemere Drive', 'Greece', 'NY', '14612', 'Single-Family', 4, 3, 2840, 2006, 'Light-filled colonial with lake views, chef’s kitchen and finished walkout.', 'A refined four-bedroom colonial moments from Lake Ontario, blending classic millwork with a modern open-concept main floor. The chef’s kitchen opens to a sun-filled great room, while the primary suite offers a spa bath and walk-in closet. A finished walkout lower level and three-season porch extend the living space outdoors.', '["Chef’s kitchen with quartz island","Primary suite with spa bath","Finished walkout lower level","Three-season porch","Hardwood floors throughout","Attached two-car garage"]'::jsonb, true, 'data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221200%22%20height%3D%22800%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201200%20800%22%20role%3D%22img%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Cdefs%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22g%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23102A4E%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%232D5BA8%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22sheen%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%220%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stop-opacity%3D%220.10%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stop-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fdefs%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20width%3D%221200%22%20height%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23g)%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20width%3D%221200%22%20height%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23sheen)%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23E4CC8C%22%20stroke-opacity%3D%220.42%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M%20168.00000000000